Hello World!

Firecrawl example
-----------------

examples/search_and_scrape.py runs a Firecrawl web search and scrapes the top
result as markdown.

    pip install -r examples/requirements.txt
    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...
    python examples/search_and_scrape.py "hello world program"

One run costs about 3 Firecrawl credits (2 for the search, 1 for the scrape),
measured against the current API. See https://firecrawl.dev/pricing

Get an API key and read the docs at https://docs.firecrawl.dev
